	quest.00A79CAA6844228D.title: "Obtain Plastic | 获得塑料"
	quest.00DFC7824C3750FB.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the &6Encased Fan&r, a &bSoul Fire&r allows it to haunt items | 当&b灵魂火&r放置在&6封闭风扇&r前方时，可以使其为物品附魔"
	quest.00F10FDD120BC630.quest_desc: [
		"Simply right click the &6Item Drain&r with a &6Mechanical Grindstone&r and then place another on top of it and you'll be able to grind away the enchantments into &aliquid experience&r."
		"手持&6机械磨石&r右键&6物品排水口&r，再在其上方放置另一块，就可以把附魔磨成&a液体经验&r"
	]
	quest.00F10FDD120BC630.quest_subtitle: "Stations to clean your &atools and weapons&r of their enchantments or &epolish some quartz&r | 用于清除&a工具和武器&r上的附魔，或&e打磨石英&r的工作站"
	quest.00F10FDD120BC630.title: "&8Grindstone and Item Drain | &8磨石与物品排水口"
	quest.010925A7252F54C3.title: "Obtain Echo Sword | 获得回响之剑"
	quest.012266C464235C7F.title: "Gather Materials | 收集材料"
	quest.0138F3EB263D1721.quest_subtitle: "A &6Train Station&r is the block that deals with train assembly and disassembly | &6列车站&r是负责列车组装与拆解的方块"
	quest.0145DD635CA8F16F.quest_subtitle: "Receives the incoming beam and &bpolarizes it&r  | 接收入射光束并&b使其偏振&r"
	quest.0145DD635CA8F16F.title: "&dAbsorption Polarizing Filter | &d吸收偏振滤光片"
	quest.0148D094A35294EB.quest_subtitle: "You'll need to be either lucky, or have a lot of thorium for this | 你需要足够幸运，或者拥有大量的钍才能做到"
	quest.014BDCB9922886EF.title: "&eBar of Caramel | &e焦糖条"
	quest.01725D55B19D3E0F.quest_subtitle: "These blocks allow you to connect &aCogwheels with chains&r inside complex systems where you don't want some Cogwheels to interact with others | 这些方块允许你在复杂系统中用&a链条连接齿轮&r，避免某些齿轮与其他齿轮相互作用"
	quest.01725D55B19D3E0F.title: "&6Flanged Cogwheels | &6法兰齿轮"
	quest.01AAA5D33720CE80.quest_subtitle: "The &6Blaze Enchanter&r is a smart enchanting table&r and the &6Blaze Forger&r functions as a smart anvil.  | &6烈焰附魔台&r是一张智能附魔台，&6烈焰锻造台&r则充当智能铁砧"
	quest.01AAA5D33720CE80.title: "&6Craft Blaze Enchanter and Blaze Forger | &6合成烈焰附魔台与烈焰锻造台"
	quest.01C410421657C191.quest_subtitle: "Press &d\"R\"&r to See Crafts and &d\"Z\"&r to See How to build Towers | 按&d\"R\"&r查看配方，按&d\"Z\"&r查看如何搭建蒸馏塔"
	quest.01C410421657C191.title: "Pollution | 污染"
	quest.021E30871E97C634.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Arm&r is an advanced item distribution machine that works by designating it to specific blocks the arm can reach. If it can't reach a location, the arm won't work. Requires &6SUs&r to operate | &6动力机械臂&r是一种高级物品分配机器，需要将其指定到机械臂能够触及的特定方块上。如果无法触及某个位置，机械臂就不会工作。运行时需要&6应力量&r"
	quest.02903C6F107C8DA0.quest_subtitle: "Finally, nuclear | 终于，核能"
	quest.02B0448DA14595B0.quest_subtitle: "The &6Contraption Diagram&r lets you visualize the forces acting on an attached simulated contraption, including &9Gravity&r, &8Drag&r, &bLevitation&r, &eBalloon Lift&r, &6Propulsion&r, &aLift&r, and &dMagnetic&r forces | &6装置图解&r可以让你直观看到作用于已连接模拟装置上的各种力，包括&9重力&r、&8阻力&r、&b悬浮&r、&e气球升力&r、&6推进力&r、&a升力&r和&d磁力&r"
	quest.02C47B1CE17E8DD5.quest_subtitle: "Hand cranks with a cogwheel installed. Handy for gear ratios and tight spaces | 安装了齿轮的手摇曲柄。非常适合调整齿轮比和狭窄空间"
	quest.02C47B1CE17E8DD5.title: "&6Large Crank Wheel | &6大型手摇轮"
	quest.02D5439ACE50EC34.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by &cBlasting&r or &cBulk-Blasting&r a piece of Coal Coke"
		"通过&c喷焰&r或&c批量喷焰&r一块焦煤获得"
	]
	quest.02D5439ACE50EC34.quest_subtitle: "An even better upgrade | 更棒的升级"
	quest.02D5439ACE50EC34.title: "&7Refined Coal Coke | &7精炼焦煤"
	quest.0306E0A1DA82A811.quest_subtitle: "A &cRedstone Contact&r component that outputs a signal when in contact with another &cRedstone Contact&r. Particularly useful for building contraptions | 一种&c红石接触器&r组件，当与另一个&c红石接触器&r接触时会输出信号。对搭建装置特别有用"
	quest.035F309A9521A315.title: "Obtain a &7Steel Ingot&r | 获得一块&7钢锭&r"
	quest.0360911A620C6613.title: "&cRose Quartz Catalyst Coil | &c玫瑰石英催化线圈"
	quest.03795968E7FA18BA.quest_desc: [
		"Place it. &eRight-click&r"
		"放置它。&e右键点击&r"
		"You can now see every shop on the server, price history, trends, and the most active traders"
		"现在你可以看到服务器上的每个商店、价格历史、趋势以及最活跃的交易者"
		""
		"The mod scans the world for &6Table Cloth&r and &6Tradeworks Shelves&r and turns them into a live market interface similar to a stock exchange with the &6Market Terminal&r block"
		"该模组会扫描世界中的&6桌布&r和&6贸易货架&r，通过&6市场终端&r方块将它们变成一个类似股票交易所的实时市场界面"
	]
	quest.03795968E7FA18BA.quest_subtitle: "&6&lCreate: Stock Market&r turns your server economy into a live, player-driven stock exchange | &6&l机械动力：股市&r将你的服务器经济变成一个由玩家驱动的实时股票交易所"
	quest.03CD30560CC82ACC.quest_subtitle: "-20% Engine power -75% fuel requirement, for those long haul trips on the cheap | -20% 引擎功率，-75% 燃料需求，适合廉价的长途旅行"
	quest.03CD30560CC82ACC.title: "&aWater Engine | &a水引擎"
	quest.03FAA1891E7D56FD.quest_subtitle: "A &6Smart Chute&r is a more configurable chute that also allows full item stacks to be moved | &6智能溜槽&r是一种可配置性更高的溜槽，还允许移动整组物品"
	quest.046435AD378CE0C8.quest_subtitle: "Best of the best magnets in store, but extremely expensive | 店里的最强磁铁，但极其昂贵"
	quest.04CEE0CA932DF671.quest_subtitle: "This Create addon adds a variety of items and recipes, introducing new &afuel sources for Blaze Burners&r and giving players unique ways to build Steam Boiler&r setups. Ever wanted a &brenewable alternative to Blaze Cakes&r? Now you have one! | 这个机械动力附属模组添加了各种物品与配方，为烈焰人燃烧室引入了新的&a燃料来源&r，并给玩家提供了搭建蒸汽锅炉装置的独特方式。想要&b烈焰蛋糕的可再生替代品&r吗？现在有了！"
	quest.04CEE0CA932DF671.title: "&2Blaze Burner Fuels | &2烈焰人燃烧室燃料"
	quest.04DA8B82DBFCA3D9.title: "Craft Electric Pump | 合成电动泵"
	quest.0512ADDB7E6659CA.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by compacting some &aCoal&r,&a a Clay Ball &rand&a a piece of Wheat&r with a &6Mechanical Press&r"
		"用&6动力压制机&r压合一些&a煤&r、&a一个黏土球&r和&a一块小麦&r获得"
	]
	quest.0512ADDB7E6659CA.quest_subtitle: "To craft Briquettes  | 用于合成煤饼"
	quest.0512ADDB7E6659CA.title: "&eObtain Materials | &e获得材料"
	quest.05422CBF447A8BB8.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by dropping a &6Shaft&r on top of a &6Mechanical Saw&r"
		"将&6传动轴&r掉落到&6动力锯&r上获得"
	]
	quest.05422CBF447A8BB8.quest_subtitle: "An early-game, single-use connector that breaks when the network is overstressed | 一种游戏早期的单次使用连接件，网络过载时会断裂"
	quest.05422CBF447A8BB8.title: "&6Shear Pin | &6剪切销"
	quest.056C707476E4BA33.quest_subtitle: "You will require either of these to insert fuel into the inserter | 你需要其中任意一种来向插入器注入燃料"
	quest.056C707476E4BA33.title: "Inserting fuel  | 注入燃料"
	quest.056C82BE2EB5AA4D.title: "Craft Papers | 合成纸张"
	quest.0573A08ED7C44CE6.title: "Setup &8Distillation Tower&r | 搭建&8蒸馏塔&r"
	quest.05BC7CBC05B15830.quest_subtitle: "Pushes heat to a small area, be careful to not pump too much heat.. | 将热量推送到一个较小的区域，注意不要泵入太多热量……"
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.quest_desc: [
		"&7Andesite&r is a very abundant stone that you can find in large pockets underground. They blend really well with the stone texture, so keep your eyes open for them"
		"&7安山岩&r是一种非常常见的石头，可以在地下成片找到。它们与石头纹理融为一体，所以要留心观察"
		""
		"&6Casings&r can be crafted by right clicking with a valid alloy or ingot on any stripped variant of log or wood"
		"手持合适的合金或锭，对任意去皮原木或木材右键，即可合成&6机壳&r"
	]
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.quest_subtitle: "&7Andesite Alloy&r is a material used in &7Andesite Casings&r and simple kinetic blocks, which serves as an entry point to the mechanical components of &6&lCreate&r | &7安山岩合金&r是用于&7安山岩机壳&r和简单动力方块的材料，是进入&6&l机械动力&r机械组件的入门材料"
	quest.05BFBACBB2337231.title: "&7Andesite&r, the Foundation | &7安山岩&r，基础之石"
	quest.063D47D4F61457BC.quest_subtitle: "A &6Schedule&r lets you schedule trains so that mobs or &6Blaze Burners&r can drive them | &6时刻表&r可以让你安排列车时刻，让生物或&6烈焰人燃烧室&r驾驶列车"
	quest.06653E21053ACDF6.quest_subtitle: "A &cPowered Latch&r that toggles on when receiving a redstone signal on one side and off when receiving a signal on another side | 一种&c动力锁存器&r，一侧收到红石信号时开启，另一侧收到信号时关闭"
	quest.071F9DA863D5E146.quest_subtitle: "Start by making bread slices with Farmer’s Delight’s cutting board, or craft a burger bun. Place a Sandwich Station, put a bread slice or bun on top, and begin adding ingredients of your choice. Along with food, potions can also be added. When you’re done, break the sandwich to collect it. You can place sandwiches anywhere by shift-right-clicking | 先用农夫乐事的砧板切出面包片，或合成一个汉堡胚。放置一个三明治台，把面包片或面包胚放上去，然后开始添加你喜欢的配料。除了食物，还可以加入药水。完成后，破坏三明治即可收集。你可以通过潜行右键把三明治放在任何地方"
	quest.071F9DA863D5E146.title: "&eMake a &2Chicken Sandwich | &e制作一个&2鸡肉三明治"
	quest.074A1D3CD1DAA784.title: "Obtain a &6Bronze Ingot&r | 获得一块&6青铜锭&r"
	quest.07680D1563629D55.quest_subtitle: "A &6Depot&r is really just a belt that doesn't move | &6置物台&r其实就是一条不会动的传送带"
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It | 按&c\"Z\"&r查看如何搭建它"
	quest.076C02684CB6D760.title: "Build Crude Oil Pump | 搭建原油泵"
	quest.07B2E02E2328F4C2.quest_subtitle: "A &bVector Thruster&r is a directional thruster that can also yaw and pitch for vectored &6Propulsion&r control | &b矢量推进器&r是一种定向推进器，还可以偏航和俯仰，实现矢量&6推进力&r控制"
	quest.08D5EBEEC4FCBCD2.title: "&eMinecart with Hopper | &e漏斗矿车"
	quest.08EA1AEF6AB1C266.quest_subtitle: "It's just a &6Seat&r, nothing more, nothing less. But if you're in a moving contraption, you might as well glue it to the contraption so you can sit and move along with it | 它只是一个&6座椅&r，不多也不少。但如果你在移动的装置上，不妨把它粘在装置上，这样你就可以坐着随它一起移动"
	quest.08EA1AEF6AB1C266.title: "&dSeats | &d座椅"
	quest.0914B65F3F737825.title: "Craft Accumulator | 合成蓄能器"
	quest.092494276E7FD582.title: "&cActivator Rail | &c激活铁轨"
	quest.0945E885A92D06B7.quest_subtitle: "The simplest way to generate kinetic energy, by using yourself as the power source | 产生动能的最简单方式，把自己当作动力源"
	quest.095C1249FDE419C7.quest_subtitle: "Melt my heart.. | 融化我的心……"
	quest.095C1249FDE419C7.title: "Uh oh! | 哎呀！"
	quest.09F5744CA666F889.title: "Enjoy your first Oliebollen | 享用你的第一个荷兰炸面球"
	quest.0A2167437E1C4F13.quest_subtitle: "A &cPulse Repeater&r sends a single pulse from a continuous redstone signal after a configurable amount of time | &c脉冲中继器&r会在可配置的时间后从持续的红石信号中发送单个脉冲"
	quest.0A6F439E158D1525.quest_subtitle: "An &6Attribute Filter&r can filter by attributes like \"can be smelted\" or \"from Create&r\" | &6属性过滤器&r可以按属性过滤，例如「可熔炼」或「来自机械动力&r」"
	quest.0AC8942A131FCC34.quest_subtitle: "Condenses up to &athree beams into one&r combining its properties | 将多达&a三道光束汇聚成一道&r，并合并其属性"
	quest.0AC8942A131FCC34.title: "&cBeam Condenser | &c光束凝聚器"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.quest_subtitle: "Gadgets for all situations | 适用于各种情况的小玩意"
	quest.0AE0E5AA8FB69FE2.title: "Welcome to Create:Connected | 欢迎来到机械动力：连接"
	quest.0B5FF13E714BF391.quest_subtitle: "A &6Speedometer&r lets you see the rotational speed of a kinetic network | &6转速表&r可以让你查看动力网络的转速"
	quest.0BB0533CA61648D9.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see How to Build It | 按&c\"Z\"&r查看如何搭建它"
	quest.0BB0533CA61648D9.title: "Obtain All the Engines and go bbrrrrr | 获得所有引擎，然后轰轰轰地冲吧"
	quest.0BBC18EB21B23D76.title: "Gather Materials and mix them | 收集材料并混合它们"
	quest.0BD86E2C95C59E1B.title: "Craft Ammeter and Voltmetor | 合成电流表与电压表"
	quest.0C15B829B4F22CF0.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by putting through some &cMagma Blocks&r through a pair of &6Crushing Wheels&r"
		"将一些&c岩浆块&r放入一对&6粉碎轮&r中处理获得"
	]
	quest.0C15B829B4F22CF0.quest_subtitle: "Perfect fuel for very cheap | 非常廉价的完美燃料"
	quest.0C15B829B4F22CF0.title: "&cBlazing Rocks | &c烈焰岩"
	quest.0C29CEB04D73AB53.quest_subtitle: "The &6Physics Assembler&r is used to assemble and disassemble simulated contraptions | &6物理装配机&r用于组装和拆解模拟装置"
	quest.0C8D19B106618A91.quest_subtitle: "The &6Gearbox&r is sort of like an extension cord, but for &6Shafts&r. It can change the direction of shafts, and can have more than one shaft attached to a different side of the gearbox | &6齿轮箱&r有点像延长线，不过是&6传动轴&r的延长线。它可以改变传动轴的方向，还可以让多根传动轴连接到齿轮箱的不同侧面"
	quest.0CD9F34CBBCA3D44.title: "Obtain Copper Sheets | 获得铜板"
	quest.0D04B64A3C45F2B6.title: "Craft Swivel Bearing | 合成旋转轴承"
	quest.0D49595D9B86A794.quest_desc: [
		"You will want plenty of &cLava Buckets&r to make sure you never run out of &3superheat fuel&r"
		"你需要大量的&c岩浆桶&r，以确保永远不会用完&3超热燃料&r"
	]
	quest.0D49595D9B86A794.quest_subtitle: "Tastes like Dr. Pepper | 尝起来像 Dr. Pepper"
	quest.0D49595D9B86A794.title: "&aFilling up the tank | &a加满油箱"
	quest.0D6431E6CC20CCC5.quest_subtitle: "+10% Engine power, for when you need that extra oomph | +10% 引擎功率，当你需要额外动力时"
