	quest.0E491A562DF88795.quest_subtitle: "&6Weighted Ejectors&r can launch items accurately over long distances | &6重力弹射器&r可以远距离精准弹射物品"
	quest.0E4AC2D4FA50A4E2.quest_subtitle: "A Create add-on for crafting custom sandwiches. Compatible with Farmer’s Delight. Build a Sandwich Station to begin | 一个用于制作自定义三明治的机械动力附属模组。兼容农夫乐事。先搭建一个三明治台开始吧"
	quest.0E4AC2D4FA50A4E2.title: "&eCraft the &2Sandwich Station | &e合成&2三明治台"
	quest.0EB48297625D6051.title: "Obtain Iron Wire Strand | 获得铁线束"
	quest.0F1D3205FB83E2D3.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in Treasure Hunts. | 可以在藏宝猎中获得"
	quest.0F1D3205FB83E2D3.title: "&aGather Materials and craft a &3Conduit | &a收集材料并合成一个&3管道"
	quest.0F76470B53D09466.title: "&eHoney Candy | &e蜂蜜糖"
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.quest_subtitle: "It's just a &6Seat&r, nothing more, nothing less. But if you're in a moving contraption, you might as well glue it to the contraption so you can sit and move along with it | 它只是一个&6座椅&r，不多也不少。但如果你在移动的装置上，不妨把它粘在装置上，这样你就可以坐着随它一起移动"
	quest.0FB4FFD361C5DF69.title: "Seat | 座椅"
	quest.0FCA9B992F6FC084.title: "Simulated | 模拟"
	quest.0FF39255BD5908AD.title: "Crush Nether Wart to obtain Spices | 粉碎下界疣获得香料"
	quest.10331210B10CF626.quest_subtitle: "Lets you use &6SU&r to break blocks, and can also be attached to contraptions to make tunnel bores and other destructive machines | 让你使用&6应力量&r破坏方块，也可以安装在装置上制作隧道钻机等破坏性机器"
	quest.1042F8DDE3975030.quest_subtitle: "The Conduit Cage will gradually turn it into Prismarine Crystals | 管道笼会逐渐将它转变为海晶晶体"
	quest.1042F8DDE3975030.title: "&aObtain &eGlow Dust | &a获得&e荧光粉"
	quest.1047F4A424FF2A83.title: "HW Capacitor and Switch | 高压电容器与开关"
	quest.1087DA469F3A10E8.title: "&eMake a &dSweet Berry Cake | &e制作一个&d甜浆果蛋糕"
	quest.109DED9EC2176A5F.quest_subtitle: "&aTransfer&r items from one container to another seamlessly | 无缝&a转移&r物品从一个容器到另一个容器"
	quest.109DED9EC2176A5F.title: "&6Transporter | &6传送器"
	quest.10A822934956DF48.quest_subtitle: "Used to craft our &dAbsorption Polarizing Filter | 用于合成我们的&d吸收偏振滤光片"
	quest.10A822934956DF48.title: "&aPolarizing Filter | &a偏振滤光片"
	quest.10C57B245C83B5AA.title: "&5The Bright Side | &5光明的一面"
	quest.10D7C5874FF7E693.quest_subtitle: "A &6Train Observer&r gives off a &credstone signal&r when detecting a train | &6列车观察器&r检测到列车时会发出&c红石信号&r"
	quest.10D7C5874FF7E693.title: "&dTrain Observer | &d列车观察器"
	quest.1124C2ECF0808036.quest_subtitle: "A heavy crossbow with a powerful punch, requires arrows | 一把威力强劲的重型弩，需要箭矢"
	quest.1124C2ECF0808036.title: "&aHeavy Crossbow | &a重型弩"
	quest.116A74318FC9D231.title: "Craft Heavily Insulated Wire | 合成重度绝缘电线"
	quest.1209EAFCD7457303.quest_subtitle: "Use an &fOil Scanner&r to check for &8Crude Oil Deposits&r from &6Create Diesel Generators&r | 使用&f石油扫描仪&r来检测&8原油矿床&r，来自&6机械动力：柴油发电机&r"
	quest.1283AD09A6377D92.title: "Obtain Slag | 获得熔渣"
	quest.12913E20A87ABA1F.quest_subtitle: "A &6Rope Pulley&r allows for the creation of contraptions that move up and down | &6绳索滑轮&r可以制作上下移动的装置"
	quest.12BE6BEC1BC8A0CC.title: "Obtain Iron Wires | 获得铁线"
	quest.12C789BF2D021A55.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the &6Encased Fan&r, a &6Campfire&r allows it to smoke items | 当&6营火&r放置在&6封闭风扇&r前方时，可以使其烟熏物品"
	quest.12D0B21E10AEEDB4.quest_desc: [
		"The &cKinetic Battery&r stores &6Stress Units&r for later use. This way it allows you to have a source of a limited amount of &6Stress Units&r whenever necessary without the need for a new setup each time. But to use this block for your needs first you will need to &ccharge&r it"
		"&c动能电池&r可以储存&6应力量&r以备后用。这样，你就能在需要时获得有限的&6应力量&r来源，而不必每次都重新搭建一套动力。但要使用这个方块，你首先需要&c充电&r"
		""
		"The &cKinetic Battery&r charges itself by consuming &6SU&r from the grid it is connected to whenever it &l&4is not&r powered on, and uses that charge to provide &6SU&r to the connected grid whenever &2&lit is&r powered on "
		"&c动能电池&r在&l&4未&r通电时会消耗所连接动力网络的&6应力量&r为自己充电，并在&2&l通电&r时用这些电量向所连接的网络提供&6应力量&r"
	]
	quest.12D0B21E10AEEDB4.title: "&5How to charge the Kinetic Battery | &5如何为动能电池充电"
	quest.12E775AF8E963543.quest_subtitle: "An &7Propeller&r provides &6Propulsion&r when powered | &7螺旋桨&r通电后提供&6推进力&r"
	quest.13620647285BECBC.title: "Craft &7Steel Pipes&r and &6Smart Pipes&r | 合成&7钢管&r和&6智能管道&r"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_desc: [
		"At the bottom of the inventory, you may have noticed a search bar"
		"在物品栏底部，你可能已经注意到一个搜索栏"
		""
		"This is the &dJust Enough Items&r, or &dJEI&r, search bar"
		"这就是&dJEI&r（Just Enough Items，物品管理器）搜索栏"
		""
		"If you type \"Wood\", for example, the &dJEI &ritem list at the right of the screen will show all items with \"Wood\" in the name"
		"例如，如果你输入「Wood」，屏幕右侧的&dJEI&r物品列表就会显示所有名称中包含「Wood」的物品"
		""
		"Adding a @ at the start of the search query will show the items from a specific mod, for example @Create"
		"在搜索词开头加上 @ 可以显示特定模组的物品，例如 @Create"
		""
		"To favorite an item, press &bA &rwhile hovering over it in the &dJEI &ritem list, and it will appear in the left panel until you press &bA on it again"
		"想要收藏物品，请在&dJEI&r物品列表中悬停该物品并按下&bA&r，它会出现在左侧面板中，直到你再次对它按&bA&r"
	]
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_subtitle: "Read my description! | 阅读我的描述！"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.title: "&bJust Enough Items (JEI) | &bJEI 物品管理器"
	quest.13D4FF6929AE8D8F.quest_subtitle: "A &6Extendo Grip&r allows for increased reach for block mining and entity striking | &6伸缩爪&r可以增加挖掘方块和攻击实体的距离"
	quest.13D833C11A71B131.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to feed the &6Blaze Forger&r and the &6Blaze Enchanter&r | 可以用于为&6烈焰锻造台&r和&6烈焰附魔台&r提供能量"
	quest.13D833C11A71B131.title: "&2Block of Experience | &2经验块"
	quest.1498C78F14A0F91B.quest_subtitle: "A &8Wheel Mount&r is required for mounting wheels. To use it, &eRight-click&r it with any wheel and the spring will automatically adjust its size to fit | 安装车轮需要&8车轮支架&r。使用方法是手持任意车轮&e右键点击&r它，弹簧会自动调整大小以适配"
	quest.14E0A5E1BA5DFA57.title: "Generating heat | 产生热量"
	quest.14F9238BF932A5EB.title: "&eCapture a Chicken by using the &bRoost | &e使用&b鸡窝&r捕捉一只鸡"
	quest.152333F57A5C1913.quest_subtitle: "A &6Rolling Mill&r is for milling raw materials into useful components, like rods and wires | &6轧机&r用于将原材料轧制成有用的组件，例如杆和线材"
	quest.1524E0F8D079A605.title: "Craft Fuel Oxidizer | 合成燃料氧化剂"
	quest.155F388D56FB4A5F.quest_subtitle: "&6Mechanical Saws&r can fell trees or allow contraptions to fell trees, as well as perform recipes like cutting blocks or stripping &aLogs&r | &6动力锯&r可以砍倒树木，或让装置砍倒树木，还能执行切割方块、剥除&a原木&r树皮等配方"
	quest.155FBDDA1C6194CA.quest_subtitle: "A &6Contraption Control&r let you turn off parts of contraptions while they are formed | &6装置控制器&r可以让你在装置成型后关闭装置的部分功能"
	quest.157DAE6EC4155F82.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in &6caves&r. | 可以在&6洞穴&r中找到"
	quest.157DAE6EC4155F82.title: "&aObtain Limestone | &a获得石灰岩"
	quest.15F53F788D18518A.title: "Build Industrial Blasting | 搭建工业喷焰设备"
	quest.160E4D26B4D8A901.title: "Materials for &3Crates | &3板条箱&r的材料"
	quest.163364A51A8AC02E.quest_subtitle: "A &8Rockcutting Wheel&r mines blocks at rapid speeds when rotated by a &8Borehead Bearing&r | &8凿岩轮&r在&8钻头轴承&r带动旋转时能以极快的速度挖掘方块"
	quest.163D0CE9361628FA.title: "Engine | 引擎"
	quest.1695EAB05715CDA0.title: "Craft Insulated Wire | 合成绝缘电线"
	quest.16C3EC6AE3C3F7C9.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we have crafted everything necessary we can finally make our &3Echo armor set&r, a powerful set that grants it's user with infinite &aResistance&r and &aStrength&r"
		"现在我们已经合成了所有必要物品，终于可以制作我们的&3回响盔甲套装&r了，这是一套强大的套装，赋予使用者无限的&a抗性提升&r和&a力量&r"
	]
	quest.16C3EC6AE3C3F7C9.title: "&bEcho Armor Set | &b回响盔甲套装"
	quest.16C68DA939A28FCB.quest_subtitle: "Mechanical crafters are needed to make the inactive blaze core item | 制作惰性烈焰核心物品需要动力合成器"
	quest.16C68DA939A28FCB.title: "Activate Mechanical Crafter | 激活动力合成器"
	quest.16CD1CC9F70A91AF.quest_subtitle: "An &6Adjustable Chain Gearshift&r can be used to halve or double the rotational speed of connected chain drives when receiving a &credstone&r signal | &6可调链式换挡器&r在收到&c红石&r信号时，可以将连接的链条传动的转速减半或加倍"
	quest.17336E4F60113C5C.title: "Gather Zinc Nuggets and Bulk Washing | 收集锌粒并进行批量洗涤"
	quest.1742597D48E37800.quest_desc: [
		"&6&lCreate&r offers great guides for most of its items by hovering over them in &d&lJEI&r or in your inventory and holding down &eW&r to &bponder&r the item, but sometimes it's best just to test each thing out"
		"&6&l机械动力&r的大部分物品都提供详尽指南：在&d&lJEI&r或物品栏中悬停物品并按住&eW&r即可&b思考&r该物品，但有时亲自动手试试才是最好的"
		""
		"{image:allofcreate:textures/qb_image1.png width:397 height:140 align:center fit:true}"
		""
		"Because of this, the chapter is mostly focused on letting you know what exists and giving you a rough outline of the progression of the mod, but at the same time, it will not handhold you all the way to the end since &6&lCreate&r is a sandbox mechanic mod"
		"正因如此，本章主要让你了解模组里有什么，并给出模组发展路线的大致轮廓，但同时不会手把手带你走到底，因为&6&l机械动力&r是一个沙盒机制模组"
	]
	quest.1742597D48E37800.quest_subtitle: "&b&lAll of Create&r is based around &6&lCreate&r, a steampunk mod that lets you build contraptions and automate most things you can think of | &b&l机械动力全合集&r围绕&6&l机械动力&r展开，这是一个蒸汽朋克模组，让你能够搭建装置并自动化大多数你能想到的事情"
	quest.1742597D48E37800.title: "Welcome to &b&lAll of Create: Aeronautics&r! | 欢迎来到&b&l机械动力全合集：航空学&r！"
	quest.175099CF5696829E.quest_desc: [
		"&9Tasks &rare things that need to be done to complete a quest. If a task is an item, clicking on it will show its recipe"
		"&9任务&r是完成一个任务所需完成的事项。如果任务是物品，点击它会显示其配方"
		""
		"&6Rewards &rare what you get after completing all &9Tasks&r. Click to claim"
		"&6奖励&r是完成所有&9任务&r后获得的东西。点击领取"
		""
		"The pin icon at the top left will pin a quest to your screen"
		"左上角的图钉图标可以把任务固定到你的屏幕上"
	]
	quest.175099CF5696829E.quest_subtitle: "Read my description! | 阅读我的描述！"
	quest.175099CF5696829E.title: "&6Quests | &6任务"
	quest.17541CB8E37D10F1.quest_subtitle: "An &6Alternator&r generates &6Energy (E)&r from kinetic energy. The amount generated is dependent on the &6RPM&r and caps at &6256 E/t&r | &6交流发电机&r将动能转化为&6能量 (E)&r。发电量取决于&6转速&r，上限为&6256 E/t&r"
	quest.17E6DCDBEEBAEEAD.title: "&aMinecart | &a矿车"
	quest.190FD2DF12D222C0.title: "&dBar of Ruby Chocolate | &d红宝石巧克力条"
	quest.19166D31F298D0D5.quest_subtitle: "A &6Display Board&r is basically an advanced sign that updates faster if provided with higher &6RPM&r. It's like the bulletin boards you see in train stations | &6显示屏&r基本上是一种高级告示牌，转速&6RPM&r越高更新越快。就像你在火车站看到的公告板一样"
	quest.19183F380B49F31C.quest_subtitle: "A &6Encased Fan&r is a very versatile machine that can pull and push entities, as well as wash, haunt, blast, and smoke items | &6封闭风扇&r是一种非常通用的机器，可以推拉实体，还可以洗涤、附魔、喷焰和烟熏物品"
	quest.1970F0B8CFF70E5B.quest_subtitle: "Use the &6millstone&r to process &alimestone&r into &aSuspicious Rocks&r. | 使用&6磨石&r将&a石灰岩&r加工成&a可疑岩石&r"
	quest.1970F0B8CFF70E5B.title: "&6Craft a Millstone | &6合成磨石"
	quest.1A541F8D6FF3C21B.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the &6Encased Fan&r, &9water&r allows it to wash items | 当&9水&r放置在&6封闭风扇&r前方时，可以使其洗涤物品"
	quest.1A75654A3BC541AC.title: "Capture Types of Fishes | 捕捉各种鱼类"
	quest.1A9BDF6B88E5A7A9.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by &cSmoking&r or &eBulk-Smoking&r Peats"
		"通过&c烟熏&r或&e批量烟熏&r泥炭获得"
	]
	quest.1A9BDF6B88E5A7A9.quest_subtitle: "Much better than Coal or Charcoal Briquettes | 比煤饼或木炭饼好得多"
	quest.1A9BDF6B88E5A7A9.title: "&aPeat Briquettes  | &a泥炭饼"
	quest.1ABC2ADBFEF3144D.quest_subtitle: "&6Connectors&r insert and extract energy from blocks, while &6Wires&r are used to link connectors | &6连接器&r从方块中接入和导出能量，&6电线&r则用于连接各连接器"
	quest.1B3F3097CE12FE41.quest_subtitle: "The thing your trains go on | 你的列车行驶在上面的东西"
	quest.1B3F3097CE12FE41.title: "Train Track | 列车轨道"
	quest.1B67448AD335E5E4.quest_subtitle: "An &8Borehead Bearing&r is used to create boreheads | &8钻头轴承&r用于制作钻头"
	quest.1B6AE2D9EE970BD3.quest_subtitle: "Ewww! | 咦——！"
	quest.1B6AE2D9EE970BD3.title: "&dEcho Cake | &d回响蛋糕"
