		"Obtained by using a Deployer equipped with a &eFlint and Steel&r and to deploy it onto a &aInactive Blaze Core&r"
		"使用装备了&e打火石&r的投放器，将其投放到&a惰性烈焰核心&r上获得"
	]
	quest.1B7DD4402C5CD447.quest_subtitle: "Most expensive way to cook steaks | 最昂贵的牛排烹饪方式"
	quest.1B7DD4402C5CD447.title: "&cBlaze Core | &c烈焰核心"
	quest.1BAE590C1F42160D.quest_subtitle: "Press &c\"Z\"&r To see how to build it | 按&c\"Z\"&r查看如何搭建它"
	quest.1BAE590C1F42160D.title: "Build a Distillation Tower | 搭建蒸馏塔"
	quest.1BDE6FE0A6240485.title: "Craft Steel and Bronze Equipments | 合成钢制与青铜制装备"
	quest.1BE274D820A20F49.title: "Obtain Lubricant | 获得润滑油"
	quest.1BE84A67C4F49130.title: "&dAmethyst Shards | &d紫水晶碎片"
	quest.1C709492F2F78BB9.quest_subtitle: "Attach to any inventory to expand its surface area. Great for access in tight spaces and smart setups with threshold switches. - Provides an interface to access two inventories simultaneously. Also comes with filter slots to quickly sort incoming items | 可以附着在任何容器上以扩大其表面积。非常适合在狭小空间和搭配阈值开关的智能方案中使用。- 提供同时访问两个容器的接口。还带有过滤槽位，可以快速分类进入的物品"
	quest.1C709492F2F78BB9.title: "&aInventory Access Port | &a物品栏接口"
	quest.1C901D6957027EB8.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Create: Kitchen! It includes three different types of mods designed to help you automate food production, cooking, and farming | 欢迎来到机械动力：厨房！它包含三种不同类型的模组，旨在帮助你自动化食物生产、烹饪和耕种"
	quest.1C901D6957027EB8.title: "&eWelcome to Create Kitchen | &e欢迎来到机械动力：厨房"
	quest.1C982C9E827813C5.title: "Sail Equipments | 帆装设备"
	quest.1CE6DB5F873483AF.quest_subtitle: "&6Chutes&r are used to transfer items between inventories vertically, either with gravity downwards or Encased Fan airflow upwards | &6溜槽&r用于在容器之间垂直传输物品，可以靠重力向下，也可以靠封闭风扇的气流向上"
	quest.1D6E3B45533738C3.title: "Craft Steel Mechanism | 合成钢制机件"
	quest.1D8DB9025EC63135.quest_subtitle: "An &8Hot Air Burner&r can be powered by &credstone&r to generate &aLift&r by filling balloons with hot air | &8热气燃烧器&r可以通过&c红石&r供电，用热空气填充气球来产生&a升力&r"
	quest.1E0AB71259E2B4DD.title: "Craft Current Transformer | 合成电流互感器"
	quest.1E3081292571CD31.title: "&cSoothing Hot Chocolate | &c舒缓热巧克力"
	quest.1E452DB4DCAD2939.title: "Obtain Crude Oil | 获得原油"
