	quest.1FE8EA6FB9329269.quest_desc: [
		"The &b&lEcho Shard&r is the first step on the path towards creating the very powerful &5weapons and &5armors&r the Deep Dark&r provides."
		"&b&l回响碎片&r是打造幽匿暗域提供的强力&5武器&r和&5盔甲&r的第一步"
		""
		"&l-&r While usually it's only found in the loot chests inside the &2Ancient City&r after many trials and errors certain &6Master Clerics&r have become able to synthesize it at the comfort of their own brewing stands letting you avoid the many dangers inside of these cities."
		"&l-&r 虽然它通常只在&2远古城市&r内的战利品箱中找到，但经过无数次试错，某些&6大师牧师&r已经能够在自家酿造台合成它，让你免去面对这些城市中的诸多危险"
	]
	quest.1FE8EA6FB9329269.title: "&bEcho Shard | &b回响碎片"
	quest.1FFF9B91CA71694E.quest_subtitle: "Lava applies a small amount of fire damage to entities below in a radius | 岩浆会对下方半径内的实体造成少量火焰伤害"
	quest.1FFF9B91CA71694E.title: "&cLava Bucket | &c岩浆桶"
	quest.2005366DA716D1AA.quest_desc: [
		"Easily the longest part of our process the conversion of &6Netherite ingot&r to the &3&lEcho ingot&r needs us to repeat the five step process of "
		"这是我们流程中最漫长的一步：将&6下界合金锭&r转化为&3&l回响锭&r，需要重复五步流程："
		""
		"1&l-&r Pouring &cLava&r over it"
		"1&l-&r 将&c岩浆&r浇在上面"
		"2&l-&r Pressing it"
		"2&l-&r 压制它"
		"3&l-&r Pouring some &dMolten Echo&r over it"
		"3&l-&r 浇上一些&d熔融回响&r"
		"4&l-&r Applying a &eBlaze powder&r onto it"
		"4&l-&r 涂抹&e烈焰粉&r"
		"5&l-&r And then pressing it again"
		"5&l-&r 然后再压一次"
		""
		"&c&nFive times over&r&r"
		"&c&n重复五遍&r&r"
		""
		"But at the end of this grueling process we will be the owner of a pristine condition &3&lEcho ingot&r"
		"但在这段艰苦卓绝的流程结束时，我们将拥有一块完美无瑕的&3&l回响锭&r"
	]
	quest.2005366DA716D1AA.title: "&l&9Echo Ingot | &l&9回响锭"
	quest.2047D5978329D0AB.title: "Pumpjack | 抽油机"
	quest.20D5607F60F7638A.title: "Craft Electric Motor | 合成电动机"
