	quest.242E73C55EA48037.quest_subtitle: "A &fHot Air Envelope&r forms balloons on simulated contraptions and generates &aLift&r when heated from below by a powered &8Hot Air Burner&r or &6Steam Vent&r | &f热气气囊&r在模拟装置上形成气球，当被下方通电的&8热气燃烧器&r或&6蒸汽出气口&r加热时产生&a升力&r"
