	quest.28DF4183D2B58BF6.quest_desc: [
		"Essential for us to make the &dEcho Cake&r the &d&lSculk flour&r is made by passing &9Sculk blocks&r through a pair of &6Crushing Wheels&r and pulverizing them to bits."
		"制作&d回响蛋糕&r必不可少的材料。&d&l幽匿面粉&r是通过将&9幽匿方块&r放入一对&6粉碎轮&r中粉碎成粉末制成的"
	]
	quest.28DF4183D2B58BF6.title: "&dSculk Flours | &d幽匿面粉"
	quest.293196C72E44A5AC.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Roller&r lets you clear blocks in front and pave with desired blocks underneath the tracks while riding a train | &6动力压路机&r可以让你在乘坐列车时清除前方方块，并在轨道下方铺设想要的方块"
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_desc: [
		"The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to add other players to your team"
		"屏幕左上角的图标是&aFTB 队伍&r菜单。它可以让你把其他玩家加入你的队伍"
		""
		"On the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, which allows you to access the &6Quest Book &rat any time"
		"在&aFTB 队伍&r图标右侧是&6任务书&r图标，你可以随时打开&6任务书&r"
		""
		"When you click the square at the top left of your player display, your &8Curios &rslots will become visible. Some items, such as Elytras and Totems can be equipped here"
		"点击玩家界面左上角的方块，你的&8小饰品&r栏位就会显示出来。鞘翅和不死图腾等物品可以装备在这里"
	]
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_subtitle: "Read my description! | 阅读我的描述！"
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.title: "&2Inventory | &2物品栏"
	quest.29649C654117D56A.quest_subtitle: "An &cAnalog Lever&r can be set to output any redstone level. It's basically an upgraded version of the basic lever | &c模拟拉杆&r可以设置为输出任意红石强度。它基本上是普通拉杆的升级版"
	quest.296F772007F1207B.title: "Welcome to &8&lPetrochem&r! | 欢迎来到&8&l石油化工&r！"
	quest.29882BA136A365CC.title: "&eGolden Sheet | &e金板"
	quest.29EFF7AED691682B.quest_subtitle: "A &6Wrench&r lets you instantly break most &6&lCreate&r blocks by &eShift + Right-clicking&r. And rotate them by &eRight-clicking&r. Your all-purpose friend you'll never leave home without again | &6扳手&r可以通过&e潜行 + 右键&r瞬间破坏大部分&6&l机械动力&r方块，通过&e右键&r旋转它们。它是你的万能伙伴，从此出门必带"
	quest.29F3FCDB8B20E164.quest_subtitle: "A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides. Conceptually uses the same internal mechanism as Parallel Gearbox, so top and bottom spins at half speed | 六个面都有传动轴的齿轮箱。内部机制与平行齿轮箱相同，因此顶部和底部以半速旋转"
	quest.29F3FCDB8B20E164.title: "&6The 6-way Gearboxes | &6六向齿轮箱"
	quest.2A0F7A2AA1C0E9C1.quest_subtitle: "A basic filter | 一个基础过滤器"
	quest.2A1B37D9EA24777B.quest_subtitle: "+25% Engine power +50% Fuel requirement. For when a Lava Engine just isn't enough by itself | +25% 引擎功率，+50% 燃料需求。用于岩浆引擎单独不够用的时候"
	quest.2A1B37D9EA24777B.title: "&aIron Boiler | &a铁锅炉"
	quest.2A5D792CD3695430.quest_subtitle: "Place near the &2Block of Experience&r during a &bthunderstorm&r. | 在&b雷雨&r天气时放在&2经验块&r附近"
	quest.2A5D792CD3695430.title: "&6Lighting Rod | &6避雷针"
	quest.2AB0806AA6A7076C.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the &6Copper Diving Helmet&r | &6铜制潜水头盔&r的升级版"
	quest.2AC910A3CE221B33.quest_subtitle: "A clutch that is uncoupled unless powered | 一种不通电就保持分离的离合器"
	quest.2AC910A3CE221B33.title: "&6Inverted Clutch | &6反向离合器"
	quest.2AF48701F4BAB034.title: "Gather Supplies | 收集物资"
	quest.2B00541A5EA7F062.quest_subtitle: "The &6Steam Vent&r works similarly to the &8Hot Air Burner&r, but uses a &6Steam Engine&r instead, allowing it to fill far more envelopes. Perfect for endgame giant air balloons | &6蒸汽出气口&r的工作原理与&8热气燃烧器&r类似，但改用&6蒸汽引擎&r驱动，可以填充多得多的气囊。非常适合后期制作巨型热气球"
	quest.2B51030D87EFB0A2.quest_subtitle: "-20% Fuel requirement. For getting that little bit more juice out of your charcoal | -20% 燃料需求。让你的木炭多榨出一点能量"
	quest.2B51030D87EFB0A2.title: "&aIndustrial Gears | &a工业齿轮"
	quest.2BC0A0977CD94919.quest_subtitle: "Place it into a depot and wait for the Conduit Cage to convert it into Prismarine Shards. | 把它放入置物台，等待管道笼将它转变为海晶碎片"
	quest.2BC0A0977CD94919.title: "&aObtain &rFlint | &a获得&r燧石"
	quest.2BC564546A48616B.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Bearing&r allows for contraptions that rotate around a point in space, particularly useful for farms | &6动力轴承&r允许装置围绕空间中的某一点旋转，对农场特别有用"
	quest.2C3CD6663D38750A.quest_subtitle: "The &6Mechanical Press&r is used for processing items provided beneath it on a depot or belt, or in a basin to compact | &6动力压制机&r用于加工置物台或传送带上、或工作盆中位于其下方的物品，进行压合"
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.quest_desc: [
		"To use this block, first you will need to &cattach it to a workstation&r that a Villager is using. After attaching this block to a station simply &dright click it with the items you want to trade&r and the next time the Villager comes to it's station the &eDepot&r will trade the items you stored into it for you and store what the Villager trades. &aLetting you trade with Villagers without needing to be present&r"
		"要使用这个方块，首先你需要将它&c附着在村民正在使用的工作站&r上。将该方块附着到工作站后，只需&d手持你想交易的物品右键点击&r它，下次村民来到工作站时，&e置物台&r就会自动帮你交易储存的物品，并存放村民交易的产物。&a让你无需在场也能与村民交易&r"
	]
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.quest_subtitle: "This block allows you to &atrade with Villagers&r more conveniently | 这个方块可以让你更方便地&a与村民交易&r"
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.title: "&2Trading Depot | &2贸易仓库"
	quest.2C7B4EE0E160A970.title: "&6Powered Rail | &6充能铁轨"
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.quest_desc: [
		"The &6Empty Blaze Burner&r can be filled by &eRight-clicking&r it on either a &6Blaze Spawner&r or a &6Blaze&r"
		"手持&6空烈焰人燃烧室&r&e右键&r&6烈焰人刷怪笼&r或&6烈焰人&r即可填充"
	]
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.quest_subtitle: "In order to get &eBrass&r, you're going to need to heat a &6Mechanical Mixer&r that's mixing &6Copper&r and &7Zinc&r ingots | 要获得&e黄铜&r，你需要加热一台正在混合&6铜&r锭和&7锌&r锭的&6动力搅拌机&r"
	quest.2C8EF8E65133D178.title: "Blaze Burner | 烈焰人燃烧室"
	quest.2C96A172ACC0226F.quest_subtitle: "Remember to cover your rods before activating... or it's going to be Chernobyl. | 记住在激活前盖上控制棒……否则就要变成切尔诺贝利了"
	quest.2C96A172ACC0226F.title: "Reactor 101 | 反应堆入门"
	quest.2CC43C68A8EECB8D.quest_subtitle: "The densest kinetic source and endgame of regular Create for Stress Unit generation, although it also has the highest complexity, requiring a steady source of &9water&r and &6heat&r | 应力量密度最高的动力源，是原版机械动力的后期终极动力，不过它也是最复杂的，需要稳定的&9水&r和&6热量&r来源"
	quest.2CC43C68A8EECB8D.title: "Steam Engine | 蒸汽引擎"
	quest.2D0B2D01669E88DD.quest_subtitle: "Simply a Potato Cannon | 就是一个土豆加农炮"
	quest.2D0BBF1DF08E9BE4.quest_subtitle: "+50% Takeoff speed. For when you forgot to build that extra ten blocks of your runway | +50% 起飞速度。用于当你忘了把跑道多修十格的时候"
	quest.2D0BBF1DF08E9BE4.title: "&aImproved Landing Gear | &a改进起落架"
	quest.2E10D93D926631F6.quest_subtitle: "An item used to craft more advanced mechanical items | 一种用于合成更高级机械物品的材料"
	quest.2E31F85F781C4BCC.quest_desc: [
		"This amazing tool lets you &ahook yourself to a block and swing from it&r gaining momentum along the way and letting you launch yourself and get enough distance to hook yourself &ato the next block&r"
		"这件神奇的工具可以让你&a钩住方块并荡过去&r，在过程中积累动量，把自己弹射出去，获得足够距离后再&a钩住下一个方块&r"
		""
		"You can even enchant it with the &dImpact enchantment&r to deal damage to whoever dares to get in your way"
		"你甚至可以给它附上&d冲击&r附魔，对任何胆敢挡路的人造成伤害"
		""
		"&o&8You can pair these with the&r &aSlime Boots&r &o&8and go even faster"
		"&o&8你可以搭配&r&a史莱姆靴&r&o&8一起使用，速度更快"
	]
	quest.2E31F85F781C4BCC.title: "&dGrapplin Whisk | &d抓钩"
	quest.2E907AC52B8EE2E9.quest_subtitle: "An &6Liquid Vector Thruster&r is a directional thruster that can yaw and pitch using liquid fuel instead of &6FE&r energy | &6液体矢量推进器&r是一种定向推进器，使用液体燃料而非&6FE&r能量实现偏航和俯仰"
	quest.2F4D033C31346B10.quest_subtitle: "Displays text or items in a hologram style | 以全息投影方式显示文字或物品"
	quest.2F4D033C31346B10.title: "&aHologram Source | &a全息光源"
	quest.2FDFF69D73F47CF8.quest_subtitle: "Fast-firing cannon fueled with gunpowder | 以火药为燃料的速射加农炮"
	quest.2FDFF69D73F47CF8.title: "&aRotary Cannon | &a旋转加农炮"
	quest.302167AFA048184F.quest_subtitle: "After crafting your first Chicken Sandwich, you gain access to a wide range of custom sandwich recipes, allowing you to create your own unique burgers | 制作出你的第一个鸡肉三明治后，你将解锁大量自定义三明治配方，可以创造出属于你自己的独特汉堡"
	quest.302167AFA048184F.title: "&eMake a &3Burger | &e制作一个&3汉堡"
	quest.306E26FB7650939B.title: "Craft Exhaust | 合成排气装置"
	quest.3079DF976F5290C3.quest_desc: [
		"This is a custom claim system that is separate from &6OPAC&r, but integrated with its parties and allies system and claim amount"
		"这是一个自定义领地系统，与&6OPAC&r分开，但与其队伍和盟友系统以及领地数量相关联"
		""
		"You can claim sub-levels (ships, aircraft, or anything) with the block using its &bGUI&r"
		"你可以通过该方块的&bGUI&r圈占子层级（船只、飞行器或任何东西）"
		""
		"{image:allofcreate:textures/qb_aeroclaims1.png width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
		""
		"You will have to use Aero Claims depending on your sub-level size. Aero Claims are obtained by converting regular &6OPAC Claims&r into Aero Claims through the &bAeroClaims Menu&r"
		"你需要根据子层级的大小消耗航空领地。航空领地可以通过&b航空领地菜单&r将普通&6OPAC 领地&r转换为航空领地来获得"
		""
		""
		"{image:allofcreate:textures/qb-aeroclaims2.png width:100 height:100 align:center fit:true}"
	]
	quest.3079DF976F5290C3.quest_subtitle: "Used for claiming sub-levels as they are seperate from regular claims | 用于圈占子层级，因为它们与普通领地是分开的"
	quest.3088C3F2E1060189.quest_subtitle: "With both of the totem parts you can now start the assembling procedure. Along with the totem parts you will also need to add the &aemerald eyes of the totem&r. This is done by placing all the needed parts into four mechanical crafters. | 拥有两个图腾部件后，你就可以开始组装流程了。除了图腾部件，你还需要添加图腾的&a绿宝石之眼&r。将所需的所有部件放入四台动力合成器中即可完成"
	quest.3088C3F2E1060189.title: "&6Inactive Totem of Undying | &6惰性不死图腾"
	quest.309779606351AC6A.quest_subtitle: "Stores kinetic stress for later use. Retains charge in item form to enable long-distance energy transport. Battery capacity, RPM at discharge and stress impact values are all configurable | 储存动能应力量以备后用。以物品形态保留电量，实现长距离能量运输。电池容量、放电转速和应力影响值均可配置"
	quest.309779606351AC6A.title: "&cKinetic Battery | &c动能电池"
	quest.30C1D45E7545FA6C.quest_subtitle: "Connect with a heat source into a boiler heater, spreads heat across all pipes evenly unless pumped. | 与热源连接后成为锅炉加热器，除非被泵抽走，否则会均匀地将热量分配到所有管道中"
	quest.30CF131DFA9D542D.quest_subtitle: "Transfer stress capacity from one network to another while keeping the networks separate. Guarantees that the source network will not be affected when the destination network is overstressed | 在保持两个网络独立的同时，将一个网络的应力容量转移到另一个网络。保证当目标网络过载时，源网络不会受到影响"
	quest.30CF131DFA9D542D.title: "&bKinetic Bridge | &b动能桥"
	quest.30D7DB66D96F6059.quest_subtitle: "\"I am you, but stronger.\" | 「我是你，但更强。」"
	quest.3103AA1D921B71BC.quest_subtitle: "As the name implies, &aSuper Glue&r allows you to glue blocks together. Particularly useful when making contraptions | 顾名思义，&a超级胶水&r可以让你把方块粘在一起。制作装置时特别有用"
	quest.3103AA1D921B71BC.title: "&aSuper Glue | &a超级胶水"
	quest.312320F8FF1FDF24.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the &6Copper Diving Boots&r | &6铜制潜水靴&r的升级版"
	quest.3163768E54FA4D87.quest_subtitle: "A kinetic source that uses the power of the wind to generate rotational force. The amount of &6SU&r generated depends on the number of sails connected to the &6Windmill&r and maxes out at 8,192 per bearing | 一种利用风力产生旋转力的动力源。产生的&6应力量&r取决于连接到&6风车&r的风帆数量，每个轴承最高可达 8,192"
	quest.3163768E54FA4D87.title: "Windmill Bearing | 风车轴承"
	quest.323F20F8AFC2C633.title: "&cMinecart with TNT | &cTNT矿车"
	quest.326B2F79F3A9D8D7.quest_subtitle: "Produce more than 1000 &fTrain Tracks&r with the same Mechanical Press | 用同一台动力压制机生产超过 1000 段&f列车轨道&r"
	quest.326B2F79F3A9D8D7.title: "&6Track Factory | &6轨道工厂"
	quest.326BB81BA22F0E4E.title: "&d&lWelcome to the Fun Section | &d&l欢迎来到趣味专区"
	quest.334E09BB534F212D.quest_desc: [
		"Obtained by filling a piece of &aCoal or a Charcoal&r with a &6Spout filled with Lava&r"
		"用&6装满岩浆的注液器&r注入一块&a煤或木炭&r获得"
	]
	quest.334E09BB534F212D.quest_subtitle: "Who in the world needs this much fuel | 到底谁会需要这么多燃料"
	quest.334E09BB534F212D.title: "&2Fiery Coal&r and &2Fiery Charcoal&r | &2烈焰煤&r和&2烈焰木炭&r"
	quest.3365EE30271B51FA.quest_subtitle: "Used for naming Simulated Contraptions | 用于为模拟装置命名"
	quest.337BA8FE36665B99.quest_subtitle: "A flexible diode that can output precisely timed redstone pulses according to a configured sequence | 一种灵活的二极管，可以根据配置的序列输出精确计时的红石脉冲"
	quest.337BA8FE36665B99.title: "&cSequenced Pulse Generator | &c序列脉冲发生器"
	quest.33B3C5F33B18C4F3.title: "&eTrain Casing | &e列车外壳"
	quest.33EB2798CA8B5B44.quest_subtitle: "Just throw a Magma Block into a set of Crushing Wheels and obtain Blazing Rocks | 只需把岩浆块扔进粉碎轮组，就能获得烈焰岩"
	quest.33EB2798CA8B5B44.title: "Activate Crushing Wheel with Magma Blocks | 用岩浆块激活粉碎轮"
	quest.34B833D58C45952C.quest_desc: [
		"The next step begins by &6heating&r a blaze burner that sits directly below a &aBasin&r and in that basin we are going to be compacting an &aEgg&r, a piece of &eSugar&r and lastly our &dSculk Flour&r which will give us a beatiful &dEcho Cake Base&r which will be used in the next step of our process"
		"下一步先&6加热&r一个位于&a工作盆&r正下方的烈焰人燃烧室，然后我们将在工作盆中压合一个&a鸡蛋&r、一片&e糖&r，最后是我们的&d幽匿面粉&r，这将得到一个漂亮的&d回响蛋糕胚&r，供流程的下一步使用"
	]
	quest.34B833D58C45952C.title: "&eEcho Cake Base | &e回响蛋糕胚"
	quest.34BDEA7471099252.title: "&dMinecart with Furnace | &d熔炉矿车"
	quest.34DAAF880FC0F5BB.title: "Deepfry Churros | 油炸吉事果"
	quest.356481588F239F15.title: "&9Fan Haunting Catalyst | &9风扇附魔催化剂"
	quest.360062DA71C3924A.quest_subtitle: "The final part of the process, is to deploy &a5 experience blocks&r or spout &a135mB of liquid experience&r to activate the assembled totem. | 流程的最后一步，是投出&a5 个经验块&r或用注液器注入&a135mB 液体经验&r来激活组装好的图腾"
	quest.360062DA71C3924A.title: "&aProsthetic Eyes | &a义眼"
	quest.3619EEA1236FDB0F.quest_subtitle: "Crash into another &bTrain&r while driving backwards | 倒车行驶时撞上另一辆&b列车&r"
	quest.3619EEA1236FDB0F.title: "Blind Spot | 盲区"
	quest.36668621669EDF51.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we obtained some &dEcho Shards&r it's now time for us to liquefy them using a &bsuper-heated&r blaze burner and a &6Mechanical Mixer&r setup to obtain some very pretty looking &3Molten Echo"
		"既然我们已经获得了一些&d回响碎片&r，现在该用&b超热&r烈焰人燃烧室和&6动力搅拌机&r的组合把它们液化，得到外观非常漂亮的&3熔融回响&r"
		""
		"&l-&r If you don't know how to super-heat you can feed our blaze burner a &6Blaze cake&r or give them a &fStraw&r so that you can make them drink some delicious &cLava&r you can find out how to do both of these things by following the &bCreate&r chapter of the questbook."
		"&l-&r 如果你不知道如何超热，可以给烈焰人燃烧室喂&6烈焰蛋糕&r，或者给它一根&f吸管&r，让它喝点美味的&c岩浆&r。这两种方法都可以通过任务书的&b机械动力&r章节了解"
	]
	quest.36668621669EDF51.title: "&bMolten Echo Bucket | &b熔融回响桶"
	quest.36B4BBB6EB3B49E2.quest_subtitle: "Finally you can craft it. | 你终于可以合成它了"
	quest.36B4BBB6EB3B49E2.title: "&aCraft &dTrident | &a合成&d三叉戟"
	quest.36D50A6AFFF2346F.quest_subtitle: "Nautilus Shells can be obtained from the ocean, or by bulk washing or channeling suspicious rocks. | 鹦鹉螺壳可以从海洋中获得，也可以通过批量洗涤或灌注可疑岩石获得"
	quest.36D50A6AFFF2346F.title: "&aObtain &eNautilus Shell | &a获得&e鹦鹉螺壳"
	quest.36ECE457C7EB0613.quest_desc: [
		"Now that we have our liquid metal we are gonna need something strong enough to handle it luckily for us the &6Netherite ingot&r is just the ore for this job"
		"现在我们有了液态金属，需要某种足够坚固的东西来容纳它。幸运的是，&6下界合金锭&r正是这项工作的合适材料"
	]
	quest.36ECE457C7EB0613.title: "&6Netherite Ingot | &6下界合金锭"
	quest.3736B545828490F1.quest_desc: [
		"You can search in &d&lREI&r for the fluids that apply by typing &e\"$create:bottomless\"&r"
		"你可以在&d&lREI&r中搜索&e\"$create:bottomless\"&r来查看适用的流体"
	]
	quest.3736B545828490F1.quest_subtitle: "Some fluids can be infinitely extracted from the world as long as the pool the &6Hose Pulley&r is extracting from contains 10,000 or more source blocks | 只要&6软管滑轮&r抽取的水池中含有 10,000 个或更多水源方块，某些流体就可以从世界中无限抽取"
	quest.3736B545828490F1.title: "Bottomless Lava | 无尽岩浆"
	quest.37760181A25650CE.quest_subtitle: "Pattern schematics can be used to repeat schematic designs multiple times | 图案蓝图可以用于多次重复相同蓝图的建造"
	quest.383B1CC5757D8729.title: "&6Tumbaga Alloy | &6图巴加合金"
	quest.38419FFA03E72E3A.title: "&6Chain Pulley | &6链式滑轮"
	quest.385C156051820A7B.quest_subtitle: "A &6Copper Backtank&r stores pressurized air for use with a diving helmet, effectively granting Water Breathing for as long as your air supply lasts | &6铜制背罐&r储存压缩空气供潜水头盔使用，只要空气供应充足，就能一直获得水下呼吸效果"
	quest.3887DB2CA518BC26.quest_subtitle: "A &6Radial Chassis&r is a useful block for building contraptions | &6放射机架&r是搭建装置的有用方块"
	quest.38C6CA73A1BFB0CF.title: "&eCandy Cane Pickaxe | &e拐杖糖镐"
	quest.390CA48CD622B19F.title: "Deepfry a snack | 油炸一份小吃"
	quest.391FA9B8D6B130A7.quest_desc: [
		"There are 3 main ways of getting &2Nuggets of Experiences&r: &6Crushing Wheels&r, &bdropped by slain Mobs&r or &dBottles of Experience&r."
		"获取&2经验粒&r主要有三种方式：&6粉碎轮&r、&b击杀生物掉落&r或&d附魔之瓶&r"
	]
	quest.391FA9B8D6B130A7.quest_subtitle: "Don't right click it or you'll absorb it all | 别右键点击它，否则你会把它们全部吸收"
	quest.391FA9B8D6B130A7.title: "&2Nuggets of Experience | &2经验粒"
	quest.3928FD010478D80E.title: "Craft All Tier 3 on Thrusters | 合成全部三级推进器"
	quest.39CF18F0C2B06818.quest_subtitle: "An &6Accumulator&r is a multi-block structure that lets you store large amounts of &6Energy (E)&r | &6蓄能器&r是一种多方块结构，可以储存大量&6能量 (E)&r"
	quest.39E865F0D72CF9B8.quest_subtitle: "A &6Shaft&r is another basic but important machinery part that is required to make anything move with rotation. You can also extend the shaft to make it longer and affect more than one contraption that requires rotation | &6传动轴&r是另一种基础但重要的机械部件，任何需要旋转运动的机器都离不开它。你还可以延长传动轴，让它同时带动多个需要旋转的装置"
	quest.39E865F0D72CF9B8.title: "Rod of Constant Rotation | 恒转杆"
	quest.39F463F266C9A44C.quest_subtitle: "Allowing you to relay &aRotational Force&r between two belts next to eachother in a smaller form factor | 以更紧凑的形式在两条相邻的传送带之间传递&a旋转力&r"
	quest.39F463F266C9A44C.title: "&6Transmission Chain | &6传动链"
	quest.3A575A5853D61529.title: "Confectionery | 糖果"
	quest.3A861B21F4724A9A.quest_subtitle: "Use an &fEngine Turbocharger&r on a &6Diesel Engine&r to make it run faster | 在&6柴油引擎&r上使用&f引擎涡轮增压器&r使其运转更快"
	quest.3A86FB6788AF5201.title: "&eFan Sanding Catalyst | &e风扇打磨催化剂"
	quest.3A95793467582862.quest_subtitle: "Muscle-powered copter that consumes hunger for fuel. Give it a good push and off it flies! | 靠人力驱动的旋翼机，消耗饥饿值作为燃料。用力推一把，它就飞起来了！"
	quest.3A95793467582862.title: "&6Gyrodyne | &6旋翼机"
	quest.3ABF20922024EC81.title: "Craft Wire Spools | 合成线轴"
	quest.3B10D31EFD80798C.quest_subtitle: "A &6Clockwork Bearing&r lets you create your own custom functional clock | &6发条轴承&r让你可以制作自定义的实用时钟"
	quest.3B925864D243F779.quest_subtitle: "&6Mechanical Harvesters&r allow contraptions to harvest crops | &6动力收割机&r可以让装置收割农作物"
	quest.3C2D6F3F116122BC.quest_subtitle: "A basic fuel for the furnace. | 熔炉的基础燃料"
	quest.3C2D6F3F116122BC.title: "&6Kindling Sticks | &6引火柴"
	quest.3C50975A0686EB72.quest_subtitle: "Used for creating different potions. | 用于制作不同的药水"
	quest.3C50975A0686EB72.title: "&aObtain &5Awkward potion | &a获得&5粗制药水"
	quest.3C67BDE80F43FF9E.quest_subtitle: "Lets you charge certain items | 可以让你为某些物品充能"
	quest.3CC4FE9A91A90C05.title: "Potion of &cRegeneration | &c再生&r药水"
	quest.3CC5FD50C31A14CC.quest_subtitle: "These will be used to make our &5Optical Device | 这些将用于制作我们的&5光学装置"
	quest.3CC5FD50C31A14CC.title: "&eGather some supplies | &e收集一些物资"
	quest.3CEC6BF0A3C288BF.title: "Obtain Wire Cutter | 获得剪线钳"
	quest.3D11842DDDE1D396.quest_subtitle: "&6Stress Units (SU)&r - a number that describes how much stress something generates or requires to run | &6应力量 (SU)&r —— 描述某物产生或运行时需要多少应力的数值"
	quest.3D11842DDDE1D396.title: "I'm so stressed! I need to measure it! | 我压力好大！我需要测量它！"
	quest.3D6ADF4135A3BE48.quest_subtitle: "An &8Tilt Adapter&r tilts rotational output based on an analog &credstone&r signal | &8倾斜适配器&r根据模拟&c红石&r信号倾斜旋转输出"
	quest.3D6E2830A657762A.title: "Welcome to &6&lElectro Energetics&r! | 欢迎来到&6&l电力动力学&r！"
	quest.3D988137341AE75D.quest_subtitle: "Let's you block incoming beams | 可以阻挡射入的光束"
	quest.3D988137341AE75D.title: "&3Tinted Glass | &3遮光玻璃"
	quest.3DADAD947C982C71.title: "Craft Gantery Equipments | 合成龙门架设备"
	quest.3DE38636656DD1F6.quest_subtitle: "&cRedstone&r plays a vital role in &6&lCreate&r. The blocks in here make &credstone&r contraptions more compact, but also a bit more complicated. | &c红石&r在&6&l机械动力&r中扮演着至关重要的角色。这里的方块让&c红石&r装置更紧凑，但也稍微更复杂"
	quest.3DE38636656DD1F6.title: "Redstone + Create | 红石 + 机械动力"
	quest.3EADB5F22FAD4A56.quest_subtitle: "A &6Brass Tunnel&r is an upgrade to the &6Andesite Tunnel&r, allowing more configurability in how to deal with items | &6黄铜隧道&r是&6安山岩隧道&r的升级版，在处理物品方面提供更高的可配置性"
	quest.3F20E1456C92F278.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Foundry Basin and Foundry Top. | 合成铸造盆和铸造顶盖"
	quest.3F20E1456C92F278.title: "Better Blast Furnace | 更好的高炉"
	quest.3F5C0F8E1B705059.title: "&eCandy Cane Sword | &e拐杖糖剑"
	quest.3F8B59B04E26C1C2.quest_subtitle: "A &cRedstone Relay&r only allows &6Energy&r to flow when it is receiving a &credstone&r signal | &c红石继电器&r只在收到&c红石&r信号时才允许&6能量&r流动"
	quest.4007D36163F8555E.quest_subtitle: "Grinding it all down to dust | 把它全部磨成粉末"
	quest.408D9361AF8AA499.quest_subtitle: "A &6Deployer&r is a simple machine with massive potential. Acts as a psuedo-player, allowing you to right click with items you insert to use them, or left click to attack and mine with them | &6投放器&r是一种潜力巨大的简单机器。它相当于一个模拟玩家，可以用你放入的物品右键使用，或左键攻击和挖掘"
	quest.40C70D05C46DCF4E.title: "&2Detector Rail | &2探测铁轨"
	quest.4106CAF7FC1EF1ED.quest_subtitle: "Water makes the area below wet, making the world think it's raining there | 水会让下方区域变湿，让世界以为那里正在下雨"
	quest.4106CAF7FC1EF1ED.title: "&bWater Bucket | &b水桶"
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.quest_subtitle: "&6Cogwheels&r are used to either increase rotational speed or extend contraptions depending on the way they're facing. Play around with the sizes of the cogwheels and see what you can make out of them | &6齿轮&r可以用来提高转速或延伸装置，取决于它们的朝向。试着调整齿轮的大小，看看你能做出什么"
	quest.410BEC9893112A43.title: "Cogwheels | 齿轮"
	quest.410C2567BCB30109.quest_subtitle: "The Slicer is used for automatic cutting and stripping when used with a Farmer's Delight Knife or any Axe, respectively. | 切片机在配合农夫乐事刀具或任意斧头使用时，分别用于自动切割和剥皮"
	quest.410C2567BCB30109.title: "&eCraft a &6Slicer | &e合成一个&6切片机"
	quest.41374A60BC001BEE.quest_subtitle: "To make some peats | 用于制作一些泥炭"
	quest.41374A60BC001BEE.title: "&eObtain Materials | &e获得材料"
	quest.413851654DCD65D3.quest_subtitle: "Get any non-dirty minerals dusts. | 获得任意非污染的矿物粉尘"
	quest.413851654DCD65D3.title: "Effective Factory! | 高效工厂！"
	quest.41423783869CBE12.quest_subtitle: "Forecast a train's arrival on your &6Display Board&r with the help of your &6Display Links&r | 借助&6显示链接&r在&6显示屏&r上预告列车的到站时间"
	quest.41423783869CBE12.title: "&dForecasting a Train's Arrival | &d预告列车到站"
	quest.42019C1C96BFD74C.title: "Craft Tri-Polar Energy Meter | 合成三极电能表"
