	quest.5F448B66C3574456.title: "Obtain Electrum Ingots | 获得琥珀金锭"
	quest.5F54692C554A45BE.quest_subtitle: "Use an &fEngine Silencer&r on a &6Diesel Engine&r to silence it | 在&6柴油引擎&r上使用&f引擎消音器&r使其安静"
	quest.5F6C37E2546789BB.quest_subtitle: "Can be used as an efficient source of fuel | 可以用作高效的燃料来源"
	quest.5F6C37E2546789BB.title: "&8Coal Briquettes&r and&r &8Charcoal Briquettes  | &8煤饼&r和&r &8木炭饼"
	quest.5FF617620A38A716.quest_subtitle: "As the name implies, &aSuper Glue&r allows you to glue blocks together. Particularly useful when making contraptions | 顾名思义，&a超级胶水&r可以让你把方块粘在一起。制作装置时特别有用"
	quest.601860A2654A4095.quest_desc: [
		"To make our &9Echo items&r we will need to upgrade them from Netherite items through the usage of a smithing table and an &3Echo Upgrade Smithing Template"
		"要制作我们的&9回响装备&r，我们需要用锻造台和&3回响升级锻造模板&r将它们从下界合金装备升级"
