	quest.601860A2654A4095.title: "&3Smithing Template | &3锻造模板"
	quest.602283C95BEFDE87.title: "Craft Empty spool | 合成空线轴"
	quest.603AAE60ABAEB20E.quest_subtitle: "Deep Dark is an addon for Create that introduces new end-game content inspired by the Deep Dark biome, featuring rare items, resources, and powerful gear to craft using Create’s mechanics! | 幽匿暗域是一个受幽匿暗域生物群系启发、为机械动力引入全新后期内容的附属模组，包含稀有物品、资源以及使用机械动力机制制作的强力装备！"
	quest.603AAE60ABAEB20E.title: "Welcome to Deep Dark | 欢迎来到幽匿暗域"
	quest.6057AD45BCBCD504.quest_subtitle: "Much stronger than the normal &5Optical Device | 比普通&5光学装置&r强大得多"
	quest.6057AD45BCBCD504.title: "&cThermal Optical Source | &c热力光源"
	quest.606349BB488D2422.quest_desc: [
		"Now that you have the necessary materials we can start by crafting ourselves a couple of &bHypertube Block&r after you put down one of them you can &aright click it while having another one in your hand&r to extend the tube to wherever you please as long as the angle isn't too steep and that there aren't any blocks in between"
		"既然你已备齐所需材料，我们可以先合成一些&b高速管道方块&r。放下一块后，可以&a手持另一块右键点击它&r来延伸管道到任意位置，只要角度不要太陡峭，且中间没有其他方块阻挡"
		""
		"Now that we have our tunnel we will need to connect a &bHypertube Entrance Block&r that is connected to a powered grid via a cogwheel to let ourself enter the tunnel, keep in mind though the speed at which you enter the tunnel is dependent on the &6RPM (Rounds per minute)&r that the cogwheel spins at so if you wan't to go &9sonic-speed&r you will need to crank that speed up to as high as it goes"
		"现在我们有了一条管道，接下来需要连接一个&b高速管道入口方块&r，它通过齿轮连接到动力网络中，让我们能进入管道。注意，进入管道的速度取决于齿轮的&6转速（每分钟转数 RPM）&r，所以如果你想要&9音速&r，就得把转速拉满"
		""
		"And lastly we have the &bHypertube Accelerator Block&r which speeds up entities that passes through the block inside the tunnel to &ahigh speeds&r which increases it's speed depending on how much &6RPM&r it spins at"
		"最后还有&b高速管道加速方块&r，它会把穿过管道内该方块的实体加速到&a高速&r，加速幅度取决于它的&6转速&r大小"
		""
		"You can also right-click the block and put it on &aBrake Mode&r which will instead slow down entities, but who even wants to brake in the first place"
		"你还可以右键该方块将其设为&a制动模式&r，它会减速实体，但谁又会想刹车呢"
	]
	quest.606349BB488D2422.title: "&b&lThe Hypertube | &b&l高速管道"
	quest.60C91DB4E99253B8.title: "Obtain Limesand | 获得石灰砂"
	quest.60D073A200595414.quest_subtitle: "A &6Stressometer&r lets you see the current stress and stress capacity of the kinetic network it's connected to | &6应力表&r可以让你查看所连接动力网络的当前应力和应力容量"
	quest.617D59D4F14FA3AE.quest_subtitle: "A &6Cart Assembler&r allows for contraptions that traverse rails in the same way minecarts do | &6矿车装配机&r允许装置像矿车一样在铁轨上行驶"
	quest.618FF4D4A0FCC14C.quest_subtitle: "A &6Wand of Symmetry&r is an exceptional building tool that will mirror your actions in one, two, or four places depending on how it is configured, for both breaking and building blocks | &6对称法杖&r是一款出色的建造工具，根据配置不同，可以在一个、两个或四个位置镜像你的操作，无论是破坏还是放置方块"
	quest.622B5B4CD721D8B8.quest_subtitle: "Propogate the beam perpendicularly and &arotate the mirror&r to choose where to propogate | 垂直传播光束，&a旋转镜子&r选择传播方向"
	quest.622B5B4CD721D8B8.title: "&6Encased Mirror | &6封闭镜"
	quest.62316183AAFBD68B.quest_subtitle: "Mixing Thorium, Stone and Clay in water will generate thorium, allowing for infinite renewability with other automation. | 在水中混合钍、石头和黏土会生成钍，配合其他自动化可以实现无限可再生"
	quest.62316183AAFBD68B.title: "Generating Thorium | 生成钍"
	quest.62C67554FAB08828.title: "Obtain Copper Wires | 获得铜线"
	quest.62D9DDC14F60CB11.title: "Craft Alternator Brushes | 合成发电机碳刷"
	quest.639561EA12D5FADC.quest_subtitle: "A &bRedstone Converter&r converts &credstone&r signal strength into a configurable &credstone&r output signal | &b红石转换器&r将&c红石&r信号强度转换为可配置的&c红石&r输出信号"
	quest.63D62E2A3E5FABD4.title: "Materials for the &dGrapplin Whisk | &d抓钩&r的材料"
	quest.63FF301B02B67929.quest_subtitle: "A flying fortress, slow but heavily armed | 一座飞行堡垒，速度慢但火力强大"
	quest.63FF301B02B67929.title: "&cWarship | &c战舰"
	quest.642172D58E8B11E1.quest_desc: [
		"You can also switch the look of your &6Water Wheel&r by right-clicking it with pretty much any &awood plank&r (including ones from other mods)"
		"你还可以手持几乎任何&a木板&r（包括其他模组的）右键&6水车&r来更换它的外观"
	]
	quest.642172D58E8B11E1.quest_subtitle: "A kinetic source that uses the flow of &9water&r as its source of energy. It will generate the same amount of &6SU&r at the same &6RPM&r as long as one block of flowing &9water&r is adjacent | 一种以&9水流&r为能量来源的动力源。只要有一格流动&9水&r相邻，它就会以相同的&6转速&r产生相同的&6应力量&r"
	quest.648C13279144617F.title: "Better Solar | 更好的太阳能"
	quest.64F520643E1E82C9.quest_subtitle: "A clutch that is only coupled if the input RPM is faster than a configurable threshold. Useful for vehicles when you have engines always on but don't want to always be moving. | 一种只有在输入转速高于可配置阈值时才接合的离合器。对车辆很有用：引擎常开但不想一直移动时"
	quest.64F520643E1E82C9.title: "&6Centrifugal Clutch | &6离心离合器"
	quest.65A2AC554D856D93.quest_subtitle: "A &6Gantry Carriage&r allows for contraptions that move across gantries. Multiple &6Gantry Carriages&r can be chained, allowing for muliple axes of movement | &6龙门吊架&r允许装置沿龙门架移动。多个&6龙门吊架&r可以串联，实现多轴移动"
	quest.65C171B1CD610846.quest_subtitle: "Used for Display and Beam Reader. | 用于显示屏和光束读取器"
	quest.65D9E2BA22CC2DBC.title: "&6Copper Coil | &6铜线圈"
	quest.65EA25D2DDEE694F.quest_subtitle: "Slow but easy to maneuver | 速度慢但容易操控"
	quest.666E9828756ADB0C.quest_desc: [
		"Can also be used to encase &6Fluid Pipes&r"
		"也可以用来包裹&6流体管道&r"
	]
	quest.666E9828756ADB0C.quest_subtitle: "The basis of most fluid-related things in &6&lCreate&r | &6&l机械动力&r中大多数流体相关物品的基础"
	quest.66760C6B0C1DDDD0.title: "&3Track and Train Buffers | &3轨道与列车缓冲器"
