	quest.68CC0DF64AD608C1.quest_subtitle: "Generates twice as much &6SU&r as the regular &9Water Wheel&r but at a slower &6RPM&r. Just know that this is bigger and bulkier, so prepare a lot of space for it | 产生的&6应力量&r是普通&9水车&r的两倍，但&6转速&r更慢。要知道它更大更笨重，所以要为它准备充足的空间"
