	quest.6933441D38037E5A.quest_subtitle: "All recipes from &dFarmer's Delight&r requiring the &dCooking Pot&r are added as heated mixing recipes | &d农夫乐事&r中所有需要&d烹饪锅&r的配方都以加热搅拌配方加入"
