	quest.694D568E65C188C2.title: "Metallurgy Expert | 冶金专家"
	quest.69519BFDAAA790DE.quest_subtitle: "Set up a Blaze Burner, Mechanical Mixer, and Basin to create potions. Place a Mechanical Pipe near the Basin to drain the potions into a Fluid Tank. | 搭建烈焰人燃烧室、动力搅拌机和工作盆来制作药水。在工作盆旁放置动力管道，将药水排入流体储罐"
