	quest.69711045D959224B.quest_subtitle: "Put Inactive Blaze Core into a Depot and activate the Deployer with Flint and Steel to fuel the Blaze core. | 将惰性烈焰核心放入置物台，用打火石激活投放器来为烈焰核心添加燃料"
