	quest.697A75979171E953.title: "Materials | 材料"
	quest.699E03EC5E7C4893.title: "Obtain Oil | 获得石油"
	quest.69A89636F2F4FCB2.quest_desc: [
		"Maybe the most tedious but also definitely the funnest &bthe Hypertube&r allows you to crawl inside the hypertunnel and zoom to the end of the tunnel at lightning speed &ano matter the shape of the tunnel&r "
		"也许是最繁琐但绝对也是最好玩的——&b高速管道&r允许你爬进高速隧道内部，以闪电般的速度冲向隧道尽头，&a无论隧道是什么形状&r"
		""
		"Come back once you've got all the ingredients and follow the next quest in line to build your very own &bHypertube&r"
		"备齐所有材料后回来，按照接下来的任务建造属于你自己的&b高速管道&r"
	]
	quest.69A89636F2F4FCB2.title: "Materials for &l&bthe Hypertube | &l&b高速管道&r的材料"
	quest.6A4CB4700F0082C6.quest_desc: [
		"The tutorial is now &afinished&r."
		"教程已经&a完成&r了"
		""
		"To view the rest of the quests, put your cursor to the left of the screen and expand the &6Quest Groups&r."
		"要查看其余任务，将鼠标移到屏幕左侧并展开&6任务组&r"
		""
		"Feel free to join our &bDiscord &rfor any other questions you may have: https://discord.gg/5mJnYNMv6Q"
		"如有任何其他问题，欢迎加入我们的&bDiscord&r：https://discord.gg/5mJnYNMv6Q"
	]
	quest.6A4CB4700F0082C6.quest_subtitle: "Read my description! | 阅读我的描述！"
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_desc: [
		"This tutorial will guide you through some basic features. Don't worry, it won't take &otoo &rlong."
		"本教程将带你了解一些基本功能。别担心，不会花&o太长&r时间"
		""
		"To start, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New quests will start to appear."
		"首先，点击「&9任务&r」字样下方的对勾，然后领取&6任务奖励&r。新的任务就会开始出现"
		""
		"If new quests do not start appearing, try rejoining your world. Do not eat the bread until the tutorial is finished!"
		"如果新任务没有出现，尝试重新进入世界。在教程完成之前不要吃面包！"
	]
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_subtitle: "To start the tutorial, click on this quest and read the description. | 要开始教程，点击这个任务并阅读描述"
	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.title: "Welcome to &b&lAll of Create&r! | 欢迎来到&b&l机械动力全合集&r！"
	quest.6A7CDF204DB01A20.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Roller&r lets you clear blocks in front and pave with desired blocks underneath the tracks while riding a train | &6动力压路机&r可以让你在乘坐列车时清除前方方块，并在轨道下方铺设想要的方块"
	quest.6A7CDF204DB01A20.title: "&6Mechanical Roller | &6动力压路机"
	quest.6ABABF2B012DB63F.quest_subtitle: "A &6Fluid Tank&r is the main block used for bulk fluid storage | &6流体储罐&r是用于大量流体存储的主要方块"
	quest.6AFD022E4050ECB5.quest_subtitle: "A &6Display Link&r lets you display real-time information on a connected &6Display Board&r or &6Nixie Tube&r | &6显示链接&r可以让你在连接的&6显示屏&r或&6数码管&r上显示实时信息"
	quest.6AFDA474C97CA327.quest_desc: [
		"In order to make a train, you're going to need at least:"
		"要制造一辆列车，你至少需要："
		""
		"- 1 &6Train Casing&r"
