		"- Enough &6Train Tracks&r to make your railroad"
		"- 足够的&6列车轨道&r来铺设你的铁路"
		""
		"In order to see how you assemble a train, &b&lponder&r the &6Train Station&r"
		"想知道如何组装列车，请&b&l思考&r一下&6列车站&r"
	]
	quest.6AFDA474C97CA327.title: "&bAssemble a train | &b组装一辆列车"
	quest.6B5D00440E177092.quest_subtitle: "Copy your written book, enchanted book, name tag and train schedule. | 复制你的成书、附魔书、命名牌和列车时刻表"
	quest.6B9D82DE26A0CC56.title: "&6Bar of Dark Chocolate | &6黑巧克力条"
	quest.6BC0D978E293515F.quest_subtitle: "Insert any furnace fuel to get the engine running. If that's not enough power for you, feed it some &6Blaze Cakes&r to superheat it and double its &6RPM&r and &6SU&r | 放入任意熔炉燃料即可启动引擎。如果功率还不够，给它喂一些&6烈焰蛋糕&r来超热，使&6转速&r和&6应力量&r翻倍"
