	quest.6C26214738805896.quest_subtitle: "Essential for anyone working with &6&lCreate&r. &6Engineer's Goggles&r allow you to see more information about blocks, such as stress impact or contents | 任何玩&6&l机械动力&r的人都必备。&6工程师护目镜&r让你看到方块的更多信息，例如应力影响或内容物"
	quest.6CD6BF0D17D1605E.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Light Bulb. | 合成一个电灯泡"
