	quest.6E5D15D4DE6F5584.quest_subtitle: "+3% Stabilizing -100% Wind effect with an electronic dashboard. For when you want to feel like an F-15 fighter pilot | +3% 稳定性，-100% 风的影响，带电子仪表盘。用于想感受 F-15 战斗机飞行员感觉的时候"
