	quest.71151BB59F5C2307.title: "Find Petrol | 寻找汽油"
	quest.712A93B1E8B43823.quest_subtitle: "A &6Packager&r will pack items from the connected inventory into a package when given &credstone&r power | &6打包机&r在收到&c红石&r信号时，会将所连接容器中的物品打包成包裹"
