	quest.72F3965D09F3B6F0.quest_desc: [
		"You can press &eU&r on the &fStraw&r to see what liquids it accepts, as well as their burn times"
		"你可以对&f吸管&r按&eU&r查看它接受哪些液体，以及它们的燃烧时间"
	]
	quest.72F3965D09F3B6F0.quest_subtitle: "Ever wanted to pipe liquids into your &6Blaze Burners&r? Just hand them a &fStraw&r and they'll slurp it straight from the pipe! | 想不想用管道往你的&6烈焰人燃烧室&r里输送液体？只要递给它们一根&f吸管&r，它们就会直接从管道里吸！"
