	quest.73877DDF85963FAE.title: "Obtain Iron Sheets | 获得铁板"
	quest.73A2838E56534342.quest_subtitle: "A &6Portable Fluid Interface&r allows contraptions to transfer fluids to blocks | &6便携流体接口&r允许装置向方块传输流体"
	quest.73CA3C62CBC41E94.quest_subtitle: "This machine simplifies channeling setups. | 这台机器简化了灌注装置的搭建"
