	quest.7452A3A5599B09AB.quest_desc: [
		"One thing not mentioned by &b&lponder&r is that the funnel can drop items on the ground when placed on an inventory and will only keep one item on the ground if it's close enough to the block the item lands on"
		"有一点&b&l思考&r没有提及：漏斗安装在容器上时会直接把物品丢到地上，只有当物品落点与下方方块足够近时，才会让物品留在地面上"
	]
	quest.7452A3A5599B09AB.quest_subtitle: "A &6Funnel&r allows input and output of inventories one item at a time | &6漏斗&r可以一次一件地输入和输出容器物品"
