	quest.74A663BECB035204.title: "Welcome to &d&lCreate: Propulsion&r! | 欢迎来到&d&l机械动力：推进&r！"
	quest.74ADDF7066B30B3F.quest_subtitle: "An &6Encased Chain Drive&r allows for multiple parallel rotational outputs, and to change the axis of the rotational output once | &6封闭链式传动&r可以提供多个平行的旋转输出，并且可以改变一次旋转输出的轴线"
	quest.74C72E26C4E18D86.title: "Obtain Energy Meter | 获得电能表"
