	quest.75BA8D3D6C0B9D1C.quest_subtitle: "The Basket and Cutting Board can be supported by the Mechanical Arm and Mechanical saw to manage numerous tasks, including supplying ingredients and cooking. | 篮子与砧板可以由动力机械臂和动力锯支撑，用于管理众多任务，包括供应食材和烹饪"
