	quest.763C356859F85A65.quest_subtitle: "First step is to saw and press a tumbaga sheet to create the head casing, then you will then need to imbue the head with the effects of fire resistance and regeneration. When that is done, a tumbaga alloy is used to seal the potions and add the iconic nose, finishing the totem head. | 第一步是锯切并压制图巴加板制作头部外壳，然后需要为头部注入抗火和再生效果。完成后，用图巴加合金封住药水并加上标志性的鼻子，图腾头部就完成了"
