	quest.776F0CA023690BC6.quest_subtitle: "A &6Nixie Tube&r can display text or numbers. This would be useful for making elevators too. | &6数码管&r可以显示文字或数字。这对制作电梯也很有用"
	quest.78446D77D11815AD.title: "Obtain Variac | 获得自耦变压器"
	quest.785322C002100649.quest_subtitle: "Keep a network running at speed with a powered brake attached. | 让一个安装了通电制动器的网络保持高速运行"
	quest.785322C002100649.title: "Overpowered | 动力过载"
	quest.78EA25B85A869DD3.title: "&aZinc Coil | &a锌线圈"
	quest.7923BEA12687E17D.title: "Craft Connector | 合成连接器"
	quest.7971AD11B9C4EBE5.quest_subtitle: "Fuel can be inserted to activate the engine and produce rotational power until the fuel runs out | 可以注入燃料来启动引擎，产生旋转动力，直到燃料耗尽"
	quest.7986DE628299BE48.title: "Craft Variable Tranmissions | 合成变速器"
	quest.798CADF6B8930572.quest_desc: [
		"Needs to rotate at at least &630 RPM&r to function."
		"需要至少以&630 RPM&r旋转才能工作"
	]
	quest.798CADF6B8930572.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Mixer&r can autocraft shapeless recipes as well as mix things like potions | &6动力搅拌机&r可以自动合成无序配方，也可以混合药水等东西"
	quest.79AAA8F409A79716.title: "Obtain Iron Ingots | 获得铁锭"
	quest.7A22F754E879815D.quest_subtitle: "A gearbox where the rotation direction of all 4 sides are independently configurable. | 一种四个侧面的旋转方向都可以独立配置的齿轮箱"
	quest.7A6C4B3AAA08E85B.quest_subtitle: "A &6Track Signal&r is used to control the flow of trains across tracks and track intersections | &6轨道信号灯&r用于控制列车在轨道和轨道交叉口的通行"
	quest.7A6C4B3AAA08E85B.title: "&cTrain Signal | &c列车信号灯"
	quest.7AA109E9271F20A6.title: "Obtain Copper Ingots | 获得铜锭"
	quest.7B0D85DA0CAD53C8.quest_subtitle: "This addon is all about transferring &aRotational Force&r with the force of &dLight | 这个附属模组全部关于用&d光&r的力量传递&a旋转力&r"
	quest.7B0D85DA0CAD53C8.title: "&5Welcome to Optical | &5欢迎来到光学"
	quest.7B179AAB6FF5DA36.quest_subtitle: "Useful for cutting food or stripping logs. | 用于切割食物或剥原木树皮"
	quest.7B179AAB6FF5DA36.title: "&eInsert any axe or knife into the &6Slicer | &e将任意斧头或刀具放入&6切片机"
	quest.7B17ACDB9B2B94E5.title: "Craft All Controllers And Data Link | 合成全部控制器与数据链路"
	quest.7B3913CCEBC7717D.quest_subtitle: "A &6Train Observer&r gives off a &credstone&r signal when detecting a train | &6列车观察器&r检测到列车时会发出&c红石&r信号"
	quest.7B9D2F7F33818837.quest_subtitle: "Essentially an upgrade to the &6Millstone&r, each of them provides some different recipes so it might be worth keeping both around | 本质上是&6磨石&r的升级版，它们各自提供一些不同的配方，所以两者都留着可能更划算"
	quest.7C0C87AECC742AC0.quest_subtitle: "Basically electricity = speed! | 基本上电 = 速度！"
	quest.7C268464F6DE1885.quest_subtitle: "Used in crafting a ton of integral machinery | 用于合成大量核心机械"
	quest.7C268464F6DE1885.title: "&5Optical Device | &5光学装置"
	quest.7C490456FC7E561C.quest_subtitle: "The Sprinkler is a block that distributes fluid over a small area below when supplied via a pipe. | 洒水器是一种通过管道供液后，将流体喷洒到下方小区域内的方块"
	quest.7C490456FC7E561C.title: "&eCraft a &bSprinkler | &e合成一个&b洒水器"
	quest.7C50408E8C98AD23.quest_subtitle: "A device that produces immense stress when powered, halting the network by overstressing it. | 一种通电后产生巨大应力、通过过载来停机的设备"
	quest.7C50408E8C98AD23.title: "&6Brake | &6制动器"
	quest.7C5CDB413D2EBD0C.quest_subtitle: "&7Copycat Blocks&r allow you to make steps and panels out of things that typically cannot take those shapes, very useful for building more complex shapes | &7仿形方块&r可以让你用通常无法做成这些形状的材料制作台阶和板，对搭建更复杂的形状非常有用"
	quest.7C5CDB413D2EBD0C.title: "Copycat | 仿形方块"
	quest.7CD315EEF62CFCC2.quest_subtitle: "Craft a Graphite | 合成石墨"
	quest.7CD315EEF62CFCC2.title: "High Carbon Density | 高碳密度"
	quest.7CFE797B0EC4A6E7.title: "Craft Thrusters | 合成推进器"
	quest.7D20EAB7E4E34B45.title: "&6Minecart with Chest | &6箱子矿车"
	quest.7D638436555FE784.quest_subtitle: "They can be used for crafting. | 它们可以用于合成"
	quest.7D638436555FE784.title: "&aObtain &bPrismarine Shards | &a获得&b海晶碎片"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.quest_subtitle: "Create: Bitterballen is an add-on for Create which adds Dutch snacks.  | 机械动力：荷兰小吃是一个为机械动力添加荷兰小吃的附属模组"
	quest.7DD05DDD6A816DFC.title: "Bitterballen | 荷兰炸肉球"
	quest.7E583EFD9E9169C5.title: "Craft Swtiches and Power Equipments | 合成开关与电力设备"
	quest.7E8E6019017D76EC.quest_subtitle: "A &aSticker&r sticks to blocks when powered by &credstone&r. Great for mobile anchors on airships | &a贴纸&r在收到&c红石&r信号时会吸附到方块上。非常适合用作飞艇的移动锚点"
	quest.7E8F42F1D630BD88.title: "Craft All Tier 2 on Thrusters | 合成全部二级推进器"
	quest.7EA4E2D90A0FBC21.quest_subtitle: "&6Diving Boots&r allow you to walk underwater like you do on land, as well as walk on belts without them moving you around. Be careful when jumping into the ocean, you won't float! | &6潜水靴&r让你可以像在陆地上一样在水下行走，也可以在传送带上行走而不被带动。跳进海里时要小心，你不会浮起来！"
	quest.7F4D5B0A7A3CA576.quest_subtitle: "A &6Track Signal&r is used to control the flow of trains across tracks and track intersections | &6轨道信号灯&r用于控制列车在轨道和轨道交叉口的通行"
	quest.7F5E2D38C40E93F7.quest_subtitle: "Lets you transfer a redstone signal wirelessly within a range using a &cRedstone Link&r | 使用&c红石连接器&r可以在一定范围内无线传输红石信号"
	quest.7FD0E84C5EBA6702.quest_subtitle: "A foundational block for the construction of a reactor. | 建造反应堆的基础方块"
	quest.7FF90225CFF62321.quest_subtitle: "It's in the ground and in trees, go get it! | 它在地下和树上，快去拿！"
	quest.7FF90225CFF62321.title: "Obtain Coal and Charcoal | 获得煤炭与木炭"
